美元中看到真正的利润，他警告说现在购买股票还为时过早。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/goldman-strategist-says-it-s-too-early-to-buy-the-ai-selloff'&gt;高盛策略师表示，现在买入人工智能抛售还为时过早&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Goldman Strategist Says It’s Too Early to Buy the AI Selloff&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/goldman-strategist-says-it-s-too-early-to-buy-the-ai-selloff</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:17:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 欧洲天然气交易商将迎来动荡的冬天</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/europe-s-gas-traders-are-in-for-a-volatile-winter</link><description>非洲大陆微薄的供应缓冲，加上不断变化的天气预报和中东战争，将继续冲击市场。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/europe-s-gas-traders-are-in-for-a-volatile-winter'&gt;欧洲天然气交易商将迎来动荡的冬天&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Europe’s Gas Traders Are in for a Volatile Winter&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/europe-s-gas-traders-are-in-for-a-volatile-winter</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:24:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 特朗普政府以不公平做法为由对数十个国家征收新关税</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/trump-tariffs-trade.html</link><description>最近的事态升级之际，政府面临着持续的法律障碍和即将上任的民主党领导的国会的新审查。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/trump-tariffs-trade.html'&gt;特朗普政府以不公平做法为由对数十个国家征收新关税&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trump Administration Unveils New Tariffs for Dozens of Countries, Citing Unfair Practices&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/trump-tariffs-trade.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:24:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] PCE 之前科技股抛售持续加剧；美国准备加征关税</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bloomberg-brief-11-25-2026-video</link><description>由于对人工智能交易前景的质疑增多，美国股指期货下跌，而美国国债在最新个人消费支出数据公布前上涨。中国称美国对其出口产品征收新关税的前景是“政治操纵”，并敦促双方维持贸易休战。汇丰银行 (HSBC) 的马克斯·凯特纳 (Max Kettner) 加入《彭博简报》讨论科技股抛售，并展望通胀数据。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bloomberg-brief-11-25-2026-video'&gt;PCE 之前科技股抛售持续加剧；美国准备加征关税&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Tech Selloff Pesists Ahead of PCE; US Prepares Tariff Hikes&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bloomberg-brief-11-25-2026-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:28:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 通胀坚挺支撑美联储再次加息计划</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/economy/inflation-pce-interest-rates.html</link><description>人们普遍预计美联储将在下个月加息。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/economy/inflation-pce-interest-rates.html'&gt;通胀坚挺支撑美联储再次加息计划&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Firm Inflation Upholds Fed’s Plan to Raise Rates Again&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/economy/inflation-pce-interest-rates.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:34:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC] 美联储首选通胀指标10月加速至3.8%，可能会加息</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/25/pce-inflation-report-october-2026.html</link><description>根据道琼斯共识，预计 10 月份个人消费支出价格指数年通胀率为 3.8%。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/25/pce-inflation-report-october-2026.html'&gt;美联储首选通胀指标10月加速至3.8%，可能会加息&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Fed’s preferred inflation gauge accelerated to 3.8% in October, likely sealing rate hike&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/25/pce-inflation-report-october-2026.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:39:51 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>